# Verified Traefik edge images for the public Compose stack.
#
# Format: <tag> <manifest-list digest>. Comments and blank lines are ignored.
# The first entry is the default: its CI leg uploads the unsuffixed
# `public-compose-linux-amd64` artifact, so the deployment guide keeps pointing
# at one stable name. Every entry runs the same full stack.
#
# Adding a version here is the only change the CI matrix needs. Resolve a
# manifest-list digest with:
#   docker buildx imagetools inspect traefik:v3.7.14 --format '{{json .Manifest.Digest}}'
